{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079410/extras/8e12055e3cda64a9ba66fa406b804926.poster.avif?t=1765913010\" width=690 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079410/extras/8e12055e3cda64a9ba66fa406b804926.webm?t=1765913010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079410/extras/8e12055e3cda64a9ba66fa406b804926.mp4?t=1765913010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Pirate Ghost Ship</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This exciting game is designed in the style of <strong>action/adventure stealth</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Horror and jump scare genre.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The game mechanics are similar to a combination of Fahrenheit and Inside games to create a high action experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The game progress changes based on your decisions and you can even see its feedback in later stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Jack, the protagonist, boards a dead pirate ship to search for a cursed treasure map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">After being imprisoned by pirates, he goes in search of the treasure map chest and after obtaining it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">and fighting with creatures, sailors and the captain, escapes from the ship and goes to the island by boat, which will be the second part of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Hope you enjoy</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>If you like the style of games like Inside, Little Nightmares, add it to your wishlist so you don't miss out.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079410/extras/bc8b39a3cf8d0db92d4d1ac010a7ca84.poster.avif?t=1765913010\" width=400 height=710 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079410/extras/bc8b39a3cf8d0db92d4d1ac010a7ca84.webm?t=1765913010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079410/extras/bc8b39a3cf8d0db92d4d1ac010a7ca84.mp4?t=1765913010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">By adding me to your wishlist, you can support me on my journey</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4079410?t=1765913010","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4079410?t=1765913010","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079410/eb95a504306ef3b7eb136d628568fef85203d73c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765913010","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079410/eb95a504306ef3b7eb136d628568fef85203d73c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765913010","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4086610,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079410/extras/8e12055e3cda64a9ba66fa406b804926.poster.avif?t=1765913010\" width=690 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079410/extras/8e12055e3cda64a9ba66fa406b804926.webm?t=1765913010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079410/extras/8e12055e3cda64a9ba66fa406b804926.mp4?t=1765913010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Pirate Ghost Ship</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This exciting game is designed in the style of <strong>action/adventure stealth</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Horror and jump scare genre.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The game mechanics are similar to a combination of Fahrenheit and Inside games to create a high action experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The game progress changes based on your decisions and you can even see its feedback in later stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Jack, the protagonist, boards a dead pirate ship to search for a cursed treasure map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">After being imprisoned by pirates, he goes in search of the treasure map chest and after obtaining it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">and fighting with creatures, sailors and the captain, escapes from the ship and goes to the island by boat, which will be the second part of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Hope you enjoy</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>If you like the style of games like Inside, Little Nightmares, add it to your wishlist so you don't miss out.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079410/extras/bc8b39a3cf8d0db92d4d1ac010a7ca84.poster.avif?t=1765913010\" width=400 height=710 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079410/extras/bc8b39a3cf8d0db92d4d1ac010a7ca84.webm?t=1765913010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079410/extras/bc8b39a3cf8d0db92d4d1ac010a7ca84.mp4?t=1765913010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">By adding me to your wishlist, you can support me on my journey</p>","developers":["Hawk Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079410/c2f1a160410f4ea9edff196be1b0fc807642a8fd/header.jpg?t=1765913010","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4079410/545498403/f8007bc6446c32afb9e9bb47e4772fe9257c65c9/1760100517/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760697025","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4079410/545498403/f8007bc6446c32afb9e9bb47e4772fe9257c65c9/1760100517/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760697025","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4079410/545498403/f8007bc6446c32afb9e9bb47e4772fe9257c65c9/1760100517/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760697025","id":257210682,"name":"Pirate Ghost Ship Game Play ","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257210682/414206894bb7e9d3955447aab4dc5801d36ce5c8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760697025"}],"name":"Pirate Ghost Ship","package